TIP:  The (C) (Em) (F) (G) progression dominates the song but there’s a quickly-paced, bouncy little  D - D   D - U - D - U  strumming pattern that’ll leave you behind if you don’t keep up.

TIP:  In the chorus there’s an (F) tacked onto the very end of the first line.  It’s meant for the next word in the 2nd line but comes in just a snit early.  You’ll hear it when you get there.  
 

